  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven statement : 11 * 10 * 10 * 240 * 2\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the * signs :\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : ×, ÷, =, +\n\n11 * 10 * 10 * 240 * 2 ⇒ 11 × **10 ÷ 10**__ = __**240 + 2**__\n\n__**11 × 1**__ = 242\n\n11 ≠ 242 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : ×, +, =, ÷\n\n11 * 10 * 10 * 240 * 2 ⇒ **11 × 10**__ + 10 = __**240 ÷ 2**__\n\n__**110 + 10**__ = 120\n\n**120 = 120 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : =, +, ÷, ×\n\n11 * 10 * 10 * 240 * 2 ⇒ 11 = 10 + **10 ÷ 240**__ × 2\n\n11 = 10 + **__0.041__**__** × 2**__\n\n11 ≠ 10.082 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : ÷, ×, =, +\n\n11 * 10 * 10 * 240 * 2 ⇒ **11 ÷ 10**__ × 10 = __**240 + 2**__\n\n__**1.1 **____**× 10**__ = 242\n\n11 ≠ 242 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (2)\" is the correct answer.",
